# Progress Log

## 2026-08-16 — Public web app verified

- GitHub production workflow succeeded after the clasp OAuth fallback was merged.
- Created a separate versioned production deployment because the prior configured ID was the private HEAD/test deployment.
- Updated GitHub `CLASP_DEPLOYMENT_ID` to the versioned public deployment.
- Verified the public `/exec` URL without authentication; it returns the hello-world page and HTTP 200.
- Spec `0.003-public-web-deployment` is complete.

## 2026-08-16 — Clasp CI authentication fallback

- Production workflow run `31962681908` reached deployment but failed because clasp `--adc` does not recognize GitHub external-account credentials.
- Updated the workflow to load encrypted `CLASPRC_JSON` credentials instead, and authenticated clasp as `dan@people4liberty.org`.
- Stored the resulting clasp OAuth configuration in the GitHub `production` environment as an encrypted secret; it is not present in the repository.

## 2026-08-16 — Apps Script deployer access granted

- Shared the Apps Script project with `clasp-deploy@clasp-website-demo.iam.gserviceaccount.com` as Editor.
- The public deployment prerequisites are now configured; production deployment remains gated on PR review and merge to `main`.

## 2026-08-16 — Public deployment infrastructure configured

