## 2026-08-16 — Monthly dependency vulnerability audit

- Ran `npm audit --audit-level=high` during session startup.
- Findings: 5 moderate vulnerabilities in the transitive `uuid` dependency chain used by `@google/clasp`; no high or critical vulnerabilities reported.
- Remediation: not applied because `npm audit fix --force` would introduce a breaking `@google/clasp` downgrade. Revisit with an intentional dependency update task.

## 2026-08-13 — Apps Script foundation

- Added the initial TypeScript/HTML/CSS Google Apps Script web app foundation, npm build/test commands, safe clasp template, bootstrap script, documentation, specification, and GitHub Actions CI/deploy scaffolding.
- Validation: `npm install`, `npm run build`, and `npm test` are required before commit.
- Google authentication, Apps Script API access, script ID, service-account sharing, and production deployment ID remain external configuration.
